  {
   "id": "claim:e39912974ac50962",
   "type": "Claim",
   "label": "The Mountain View dojo was not started by Sig Kufferath and Robert Nadeau. It opened while Nadeau was still in Japan. It",
   "canonical_name": null,
   "metadata": {
    "claim_text": "The Mountain View dojo was not started by Sig Kufferath and Robert Nadeau. It opened while Nadeau was still in Japan. It was started by Sig Kufferath and Ed Riggs, who was a retired army officer who studied Aikido in Japan while he was stationed there. Also involved was Ed Dressen who provided the financing to get the school started.",
